Set StretchDD$Dir <Obey$Dir>

| Coo, RISC OS 3.5 ROM modules for a change ;-)
|
RMEnsure Toolbox  0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Toolbox
RMEnsure Window   0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Window
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.ProgInfo
RMEnsure Menu     0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Menu

RMEnsure Toolbox  1.36 Set StretchDD$ToolboxMod Toolbox 1.36
RMEnsure Window   1.31 Set StretchDD$ToolboxMod Window 1.31
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0.09 Set StretchDD$ToolboxMod Window 0.09
RMEnsure Menu     0.24 Set StretchDD$ToolboxMod Menu 0.24

If "<StretchDD$ToolboxMod>"<>"" Then Error 0 Some, or all of your Toolbox modules are out of date (couldn't find <StretchDD$ToolboxMod>).  You can find updates at http://www.acorn.co.uk/.

Wimpslot -min 32k -max 32k
Run <StretchDD$Dir>.!Runimage
